    "text": "Vesttoo Creditors File Landmark Lawsuit Against Aon and China Construction Bank for Fraudulent Conduct Leading to Vesttoo’s Collapse and Billions in Insurance Industry Claims By: via August 14, 2025 at 00:00 AM EDT Complaint alleges Aon aggressively and fraudulently marketed and scaled its CPI product, inducing Vesttoo into risky transactions based on false representations\nLawsuit details how Vesttoo’s bankruptcy was a direct result of Aon’s misconduct, lack of diligence on Vesttoo-obtained LOCs, and blatant disregard for signs of fraud\nComplaint alleges China Construction Bank enabled employee’s conspiracy to produce $2.8 billion in forged collateral",
